>> title: Basic Vinaigrette
>> category: Dressings & Dips
>> tags: salad, olive oil, vinegar, no-cook
>> counters: Deli
>> aka: house vinaigrette, oil and vinegar, red wine vinaigrette
>> servings: 8
>> time: 15 min
>> step.1: macerate 10 min
>> step.2: whisk in
>> step.3: stream in, whisk to emulsify

Macerate @shallot{1%Tbs}(minced) in @red wine vinegar{1/4%cup}(60 mL) with @kosher salt{1/2%tsp} for ~{10%min}.

Whisk @dijon mustard{1%tsp}, @honey{1/2%tsp}, and @black pepper{1/4%tsp} into @&(~1)vinegar{}.

Stream @extra-virgin olive oil{3/4%cup}(180 mL) into @&(~1)base{} in a thin thread, whisking until it emulsifies.
